  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Risk Mitigation and Adaptation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Albania Disaster Risk Mitigation and Adapation Project (AL-DRMAP) is to strengthen institutional capacities (a) to reduce Albania&apos;s vulnerability to natural and man-made hazards; and (b) to limit human, economic, and financial losses due to these disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
